    "updated_at": "2019-10-22T17:02:54Z",
    "body": "Right, my understanding was that this was just bringing the spec in line with existing browsers by fixing a logic bug, so we shouldn't need any new statements of implementer support.\r\n\r\nSimilarly, I'm not sure we should impose the tests requirement on a logic bug fix, but it would be good to ensure that there's coverage for this scenario if it's not too much trouble.",
